== Trivia ==
* King Baby references the official ''Binding of Isaac'' tarot card set, in which {{C|???}} represents the Emperor.
* The Steam achievement description for unlocking King Baby says "Unlocked a new [[Co-op|co-player baby]]," despite it being an item.
* {{dlc|r}} King Baby's pickup quote is a reference to the film ''[[wikipedia:Army of Darkness|Army of Darkness]]'', where the protagonist Ash says "Hail to the king, baby!".  The same quote also appears in [[wikipedia:Duke Nukem 3D|Duke Nukem 3D]].

